{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/266856-some-owod-fan-fiction","id":266856,"title":"Some OWoD Fan-fiction.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-27T10:50:55-07:00","id":266856,"title":"Some OWoD Fan-fiction.","content":"Why? Because I can't draw so a web comic is right out. A story I'm writing out It's basic outline is done. This is the base by Exalted Fan-fiction is built on but has no Exalted elements so stands alone.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table_table text_table_table-striped\" style=\"width: 100%\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr\"><td colspan=\"3\" class=\"text_table_table_td text_table_table-striped_td\" style=\"background-color: #F9F9F9; padding: 4px\"><a href=\"https://www.fanfiction.net/s/10698603/1/The-Tale-of-the-Seven\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.fanfiction.net/s/1069860...e-of-the-Seven</a></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_table_tr text_table_table-striped_tr\"></tr> </table></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I used to be Median but life has made me Mean.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1753-avrjoe","name":"Avrjoe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1753_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-10T07:54:13-07:00","id":277228,"title":"","content":"I've posted Chapter 2. It introduces a Mage and a Projector into the mix.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I used to be Median but life has made me Mean.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1753-avrjoe","name":"Avrjoe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1753_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-10T11:14:01-07:00","id":277390,"title":"","content":"So this is basically the plot from Vampire: Bloodlines, but with an extra werewolf and hunter?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PbrO9Kq.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2211-sixfootchicken","name":"SixFootChicken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"559"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-10T15:35:44-07:00","id":277623,"title":"","content":"Basically it starts that way but doesn't remain that close to the game.<br /> <br /> I used the CRPG like it was an adventure module as the adventure began things cleaved pretty straight to the game. As the players advanced in power while they confronted much the same situations that the game presented their responses varied wildly. I did include other things going on that were not vampire based mostly that deal with the other supernatural groups. I merged the four games I ran with different groups into one narrative that is not quite any one game I had run.<br /> <br /> The final group that makes up the Seven are.<br /> <br /> Keith MacDowall - An MD in Haematology he has gone back to school and recently received his PHD in biochemistry. He served in the Army in Afghanistan where he was injured by an IED and nearly lost an arm he fills the roll of the protagonist from the game. He is transformed into a vampire during the first part of the story and this sets events in motion so to speak.<br /> <br /> Alex Silbern - A former US Army Ranger. He's a skilled combatant but dislikes the werewolf world view. He is a slightly less righteous Captain America. He feels a duty to protect and help people the idea of things the werewolves did in the past makes him dislike many of his fellows.<br /> <br /> Remington Spectre - A Hunter Judge he holds all beings should be held to roughly the same standard. He's sort of a cross between Indiana Jones John Wayne and Dirty Harry. He's the most knowledgeable on the general world of the supernatural. His information does have holes however.<br /> <br /> Maria Grove - A Orpheus line Projector. Maria never linked up with any other Orpheus survivors. She seems quite and skittish but that hides a core of strength of will. Aside for Keith she's the least knowledgeable about the general world of the supernatural all of her information is focused on ghosts.<br /> <br /> Ezekiel Mason - Or at least that's what he goes by. A Tremere vampire who has more then a few irons in the fire. Zeke is knowingly being used as a cats-paw by higher forces in his clan. If he pulls off all of his goals he will attain power undreamed by mere apprentices. Should he fail he will be liquidated and the blame for his work tossed solely on himself.<br /> <br /> Nikki Sparks - An Etherite magus who seeks to unlock mystery's related to Orpheus. She sees Orpheus' existence as a crack in the Technocracies armor. She hopes to widen the crack and expose people to more mystic phenomena. Where others try bold strides she hopes to crumble the Technocratic paradigm in the same way tree roots break up concrete. One crack at a time.<br /> <br /> Halinka Przemyslawa Podolski - A non-Sabbat Tzmisic monk of the line of some of the Tzmisic monks who survived the initial fall of Constantinople. She has her own spiritual and temporal goals. She is currently the most exclusive and richest plastic surgeon in Hollywood.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I used to be Median but life has made me Mean.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1753-avrjoe","name":"Avrjoe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1753_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-14T08:03:06-08:00","id":312259,"title":"","content":"Part Three is up of their continued adventure slowly the party comes together.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I used to be Median but life has made me Mean.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1753-avrjoe","name":"Avrjoe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1753_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-19T07:58:18-08:00","id":375257,"title":"","content":"Part Four some Larger plots are revealed, along with ideas I stole from NWoD peeking in a bit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I used to be Median but life has made me Mean.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1753-avrjoe","name":"Avrjoe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1753_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-20T01:18:27-08:00","id":375961,"title":"","content":"One I wrote I will likely never update... that is a few weeks too late...<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.fanfiction.net/s/3124449/1/A-very-happy-Christmas-Christolf\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.fanfiction.net/s/3124449...tmas-Christolf</a><br /> <br /> Christolf and his coterie, from &quot;Redemption&quot; Celebrate christmas... was bored and noticed how the holiday had to have happened twice while they were togetherer, once for his dark ages coterie, once for his modern coterie.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-26T17:13:28-08:00","id":382493,"title":"","content":"It was short but had a promising start. I never got around to playing redemption I think I'll have to remedy that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I used to be Median but life has made me Mean.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1753-a